---
import SlideLayout from "../../../components/presentations/hosting-at-home/SlideLayout.astro";
import ContentSlide from "../../../components/presentations/hosting-at-home/ContentSlide.astro";
---

<SlideLayout title="The Old Way">
    <ContentSlide title="Port Forwarding" eyebrow="The Old Way">
        <ul>
            <li>Must open inbound ports on your router (80, 443, SSH...)</li>
            <li>Every open port is a potential attack surface</li>
            <li>IP can be scanned, DDoS'd, or brute-forced directly</li>
            <li>IP changes when your ISP feels like it — DNS breaks</li>
            <li>No protection layer between attacker and your machine</li>
        </ul>
    </ContentSlide>
</SlideLayout>
